room_covers.description:
For each shutter: which contact opens it, whether it is in front of a window or a door, and how far it opens then (0 = closed, 100 = fully open; empty: 30 % for a window, 100 % for a door).

While the contact is open, the shutter moves to this position and stays there, also against buttons, app, plan and automations. The last command is carried out once the contact is closed again. For a door this keeps you from being locked out.

{covers}
